{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07433","headline":"岁日见新历因寄都官裴郎中 · 刘长卿","name":"岁日见新历因寄都官裴郎中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"青阳振蛰初颁历，白首衔冤欲问天。\n绦老更能经几岁，贾生何事又三年。\n愁占蓍草终难决，病对椒花倍自怜。\n若道平分四时气，南枝爲底发春偏。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07433.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07433","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}